sine: dc ignored, tdphase, phase AC only, hold before delay, damping
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource type="sine" dc=5 sinedc=1 ampl=2 freq=1k
v2 (b 0) vsource type="sine" sinedc=1 ampl=2 freq=1k delay=0.25m tdphase=90
v3 (c 0) vsource type="sine" phase=90
v4 (d 0) vsource type="sine" sinedc=1 ampl=2 freq=1k theta=1k delay=0.25m
v5 (e 0) vsource type="sine" sinedc=1 ampl=2 freq=1k delay=-0.25m
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
  analysis tr1 tran stop=1m step=1n maxstep=0.5u
endc
